#: ../../zh/triton_api/Reduction_Ops/reduce.md:5
msgid ""
"简介：`triton.language.reduce` 沿指定轴 `axis` 对输入 tensor 应用 `combine_fn` "
"进行规约，返回规约后的结果张量。"
msgstr ""
"Description: `triton.language.reduce` applies `combine_fn` along the "
"specified `axis` of the input tensor to perform reduction, returning the "
"reduced result tensor."

